- Stroke risk: The CHA2DS2-VASc score estimates stroke risk in AF. Components: Congestive HF (1), Hypertension (1), Age 75+ (2), Diabetes (1), Prior stroke/TIA (2), Vascular disease (1), Age 65–74 (1), Female sex (1). Diabetes adds 1 point. Depending on your other conditions and sex, your overall score could change the anticoagulation recommendation.
