- CHA2DS2‑VASc: scoring estimates stroke risk and guides anticoagulation. Components: Congestive HF (1), Hypertension (1), Age ≥75 (2), Diabetes (1), Stroke/TIA (2), Vascular disease (1), Age 65–74 (1), Sex category female (1). With the information you gave (age 55 and diabetes):  
