- Options: DOACs (apixaban, rivaroxaban, dabigatran, edoxaban) vs warfarin. DOACs have fewer monitoring needs and generally lower intracranial bleeding risk; warfarin is preferred in mechanical valves or severe renal failure and allows monitoring via INR.  
