2. If you have palpitations or known AF, ask Dr. Wilson for ECG and discuss anticoagulation vs observation based on CHA2DS2-VASc. If new AF or symptomatic, ask for cardiology referral (Colorado Cardiology or electrophysiology).  
3. Bring the checklist/tests above to your physical. If you want, I can draft a short message/email to Dr. Wilson requesting specific tests and/or a referral — tell me if you want that and whether to ask for a general cardiology consult or electrophysiology specifically.

