Good — I can help you get organized for the visit. A few clarifying questions first, because the answers will change what’s most important to discuss with your PCP and whether cardiology referral is needed:

Questions for you
- Do you already have a diagnosis of atrial fibrillation (AF)? If so, when was it diagnosed and how was it diagnosed (ECG, Holter, etc.)?
- Do you have symptoms now (palpitations, lightheadedness, shortness of breath, chest pain, syncope)?
