- “I have type 2 diabetes and a history of depression and GERD. I’m concerned about stroke risk from atrial fibrillation and how my kidney function affects anticoagulant choices. Can we calculate my CHA2DS2‑VASc and HAS‑BLED now, review my eGFR, and decide whether I should start or continue anticoagulation? If my kidney function or symptoms complicate management, would you refer me to cardiology (Colorado Cardiology) or cardiology electrophysiology?”

