- “Are there drug interactions between my current meds (omeprazole, gabapentin, antidepressants) and anticoagulants I should know about?”
- “Given my diabetes and age, do you recommend referral to Colorado Cardiology now or only if I develop symptoms/failed initial management?”
- “Do I need closer monitoring for kidney function or other labs if I start a DOAC?”

