- Do I need an echocardiogram, ambulatory monitor (Holter/patch), or thyroid test?
- If I have symptoms, should we try rate control first (beta-blocker, calcium-channel blocker) or rhythm control (antiarrhythmic drugs, cardioversion, ablation)?
- Given my age (55) and diabetes, do you recommend referral to cardiology/electrophysiology for specialized management?

