I can help — this is a good set of concerns to raise at your annual. I’ll first outline the main issues you should clarify, the tests and scores your PCP (Dr. Wilson) will likely use, when a referral to cardiology is recommended, and suggested questions to bring. A few quick clarifying questions at the end so my recommendations can be more specific.

1) Quick clarifications I need from you
