- ECG (12-lead) to document rhythm.
- If AF already known or symptoms intermittent: ambulatory monitor/Holter or event monitor documentation.
- Echocardiogram (if structural heart disease or new diagnosis of AF) — evaluates valve disease, chamber size, EF.
