I can help — first a couple quick clarifying questions, then I’ll give you a concise checklist and suggested questions to take to Dr. Wilson.

Clarifying questions
- Do you already have a diagnosis of atrial fibrillation (AF), or are you asking about AF prevention/assessment because of symptoms/findings?
- Are you currently taking any anticoagulant (warfarin, apixaban, rivaroxaban, dabigatran, etc.)? Any prior stroke/TIA or major bleeding?
